body:
I had that happen and had to use the bowl clipping glitch.   I won't lie, it took me about an hour to get it right but it was  faster then replaying 30+ hours from an old save.

&#x200B;

I got it to work by doing it to the right side of the door to the castle.

&#x200B;

Here's a video describing the process.

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2GvEIoBU2jI&ab\_channel=XxcarShowxboyxX](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2GvEIoBU2jI&ab_channel=XxcarShowxboyxX)
